== Summary guidance ==
- If a subnet has NO default route, nodes in it will only bootstrap reliably if you have VPC endpoints for ECR API, ECR DKR, S3, and STS.
- If you intend these to be private worker subnets, you usually want 0.0.0.0/0 -> nat-... in the associated route table.
- Your earlier output showed the *main* route table has only the local route; so new subnets that inherit it will not have egress.
